Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:03:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test(model): check the Transformers backend attention on
 CPU

Compare the paged-KV attention function with reference causal attention
for a padded prefill, batched decode with a padded batch row (block table
-1, slot -1), a sliding window, and a segmented prefill reading the first
chunk back from the cache.

